Taxonomy: US GAAP 2026
**/


rule-name-prefix DQC

/** V32 Release **/
/**

Overview: Schedule III Real Estate and Accumulated Depreciation (SEC Regulation S-X 12-28) reports information by property.  The appropriate axis to identify each property in this schedule is srt:RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis.  When needed the type of property can be identified using srt:MortgageLoansOnRealEstateDescriptionTypeOfPropertyAxis and the location of the property can be identified using srt:StatementGeographicalAxis.

Filers have been using inappropriate axes to identify the properties in Schedule III such as BusinessAcquisitionAxis, RealEstatePropertiesAxis, PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis and srt:ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis.

Rule US.0253.10973 checks that the table used for Schedule III (srt:RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationByPropertyTable) does not include any of these inappropriate axes.

**/

constant $SCHEDULE_III_INCORRECT_AXES = set(BusinessAcquisitionAxis,
											RealEstatePropertiesAxis,
											PropertyPlantAndEquipmentByTypeAxis,
											srt:ScheduleOfEquityMethodInvestmentEquityMethodInvesteeNameAxis)

ASSERT US.0253.10973 SATISFIED

$rule_id = (rule-name().split('.'))[rule-name().split('.').length];

/** DQCRT RULE **/
if not applicable_form(rule-name())
	skip
else

$scheduleIIICubes = filter taxonomy().cubes where $item.cube-concept.name == srt:RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationByPropertyTable

for $cube in $scheduleIIICubes
	$incorrectAxes = $cube.dimensions.concept.name.to-set intersect $SCHEDULE_III_INCORRECT_AXES
	$correctAxes = $cube.dimensions.concept.name.to-set intersect set(srt:RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis)

	$incorrectAxes.length > 0 and $correctAxes.length == 0

message
"The Schedule III table srt:RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationByPropertyTable in the section \"{$cube.drs-role.description}\" includes the axis {$incorrectAxes.sort.join(', ')}.  This axis should not be used to identify properties reported in Schedule III Real Estate and Accumulated Depreciation.  The appropriate axis to identify each property in this schedule is srt:RealEstateAndAccumulatedDepreciationDescriptionOfPropertyAxis.  When needed, the type of property can be identified using the srt:MortgageLoansOnRealEstateDescriptionTypeOfPropertyAxis and the location of the property can be identified using srt:StatementGeographicalAxis.  Please replace the axis {$incorrectAxes.sort.join(', ')} with the appropriate axis.

Rule Element Id:{$rule_id}
Rule version: {$ruleVersion}"

severity error

effectiveDate $effective_dates[$rule_id]
